Error [jet.UnknownContextField]: `scheduler` isn't a context field or key
  --> tests/ui/context_unknown_field.jet:7:14
    |
  7 |     #Context(scheduler: arena) {
    |              ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Context` sets `allocator`, `logger` and `on_stop`, and the constants a package declares with `#ContextKey`
 Fix: Declare `#ContextKey scheduler: …` or write `#Context(allocator: …)`, `#Context(logger: …)` or `#Context(on_stop: …)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0761
